 whole message boards and subforums dedicated to donors and their patrons.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'd rather chug a gallon of nyqul then eat ONE piece of lettuce...I take fiber supplements and eat bread cause my tummy would kill me if i didnt get fiber. (real mature Dana, start talking about shit. lol )<br /> <br /> That image sounds interesting as to how you feed, it seems simple but also feels like it is more complicated then can be easily explained. Its great that you are kind enough to not feed off of people without permission, I cant imagine feeding off someone without asking, it would be...rude? especially if it could make them sick. I know the types of people you talk about when talking about energy creators, I can tell when people have high energy they damn near radiate it. Pisses me off that they have it and seem perky and i'm sitting her frumpy, and exsausted and drained, because others around me take everything i have. (If that makes sense, I cant stand crowds because of this, it feels like i'm being drained and cant stop it from happening, but this could be an anxiety issue and not metaphysical in nature) I have always been one to be drawn to emotions, i avoid people if i can as to long around them makes me tired, i dont let people touch me especially strangers, if I let someone touch me it is a sign of great respect, and touching me while i'm sleeping is even worse as the control i have to not pick up on emotion and it fucks with me hard. <br /> Although its given me a wonderful insight to my daughter, I hold her constnatly, and LOVE sleeping with her against me, as i can feel her happy content energy, and I wake up when she starts to get upset before she even is awake herself. I hate when i feel she's upset and dont know why, but I LOVE when i see her face light up when shes happy with me and i can feel it so strongly coming off her that my heart melts. (I went off topic sorry not sorry XD my hands typed before i could stop them) <br /> <br /