ally. You seem very sensitive to energy absorption, both with your energy and others. Often when feeding, I'll take some of my donor's emotions for awhile. You seem to pick it up whether you want to or not when contact is involved. With the baby, I suppose feeling her is actually a help, being the mommy.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Forgive me, but autovampirisim desnt sound like it would be very fufilling, is the point of feeding not to gain energy etc? Drinking your own blood, i dont see how you could gain anything beyond comfort from it, as you are expending energy/blood. Correct me if i'm wrong this is clearly something I know jack shit about </div> </div> </div>If you'll notice, I did say it was largely symbolic. The point of feeding IS to gain energy and autovampirism doesn't garner one any. Really, it's a reminder of feeding, being able to taste living blood. It was just for emotional purposes, and because a friend was really self-conscious about their desire to try sanguine feeding. It was basically a demonstration as to how generally painless and unnoticeable the practice could be. They had pictured very visible feeding wounds and serious blood loss. They were certainly relieved to find it was more of a deep scratch/syringe thing and a few drops, or maybe spoonfuls if you're drinking deeply.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> *On a side note, describing a persons inner self down to appearance and personality is fucking creeping me out, How does one describe to someone in detail thier innerself, that just happens to be a being you've seen in your dream for YEARS before meeting them!? Its beyond bizzare but i dont believe in conincidence. My guide is my friend, oddly